  "html_sha256": "5f3e2807d86d8ed9b8d11f52b12068d118e63a8a1b460f2b314c4c557e4a327d",
  "source": "Cite ((bibcite gamma)) then ((bibcite alpha)) then ((bibcite beta)).\n[[bibliography]]\n: alpha : Alpha text\n: beta : Beta text\n: gamma : Gamma text\n[[/bibliography]]",
